OL,3,ABlasts heard as US Army carries out
OL,4,Acontrolled detonation of degraded
OL,5,Aexplosives in Iowa
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn explosion has been heard in
OL,8,FMiddletown, Iowa, where the US Army is
OL,9,Fdetonating five tonnes of degraded
OL,10,Fexplosives
OL,12,FThe controlled detonation of 68 barrels
OL,13,Fof lead azide - a highly volatile
OL,14,Fcompound - is necessary to prevent an
OL,15,Funplanned explosion, the Army says
OL,17,FIt has also warned locals of "potential
OL,18,Fexposure to toxic lead dust" - an
OL,19,Foptional evacuation zone and a 20-mile
OL,20,Fshelter in place advisory are among the
OL,21,Fmeasures in place
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
