OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABlasts heard as US Army carries out
OL,4,Acontrolled detonation of degraded
OL,5,Aexplosives in Iowa
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe detonation comes after an appeals
OL,8,Fcourt overturned a decision to stop the
OL,9,Fblast over concerns about potential
OL,10,Fhealth hazards from lead exposure
OL,12,FMiddletown resident Trisha Kraus says:
OL,13,F"I actually want it to happen, because
OL,14,FI'd rather it be controlled than just
OL,15,Fblow up". But farmer Margo Sprenger
OL,16,Ffears "it's going to change my life
OL,17,Fforever"
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
